      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was officially platted in 1852 when the Indianapolis‑Bellefontaine Railroad reached the area, making it a key rail stop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.in.gov/history/state-historical-markers/find-a-marker/farmland-downtown-historic-district/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Farmland’s downtown historic district earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 1994, preserving its 19th‑century charm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
